      "How do I invite my partner or family?": "如何邀请伴侣或家人？",
      "Go to Together and share your invite link or code. When they sign up with it, you'll share one budget.": "在「一起」中分享邀请链接或邀请码。对方用它注册后，你们就共用一个预算。",
