      "How do monthly budgets work?": "月度预算怎么用？",
      "In Plan, tap Edit next to Budget and set a limit for any category. Bun gives you a heads-up at 80%.": "在「计划」中点「预算」旁的「编辑」，为任意类别设上限。达到 80% 时 Bun 会提醒你。",
      "How do I split an expense?": "如何分摊一笔支出？",
